{"german_text": "Die Telemedizin hat an Bedeutung gewonnen.", "english_translation": "Telemedicine has gained importance.", "arabic_translation": "اكتسب الطب عن بعد أهمية.", "level": "B2", "difficulty_score": 7, "category": "Medicine"},
{"german_text": "Die personalisierte Medizin ist die Zukunft.", "english_translation": "Personalized medicine is the future.", "arabic_translation": "الطب الشخصي هو المستقبل.", "level": "B2", "difficulty_score": 7, "category": "Medicine"},
{"german_text": "Die Epidemie wurde unter Kontrolle gebracht.", "english_translation": "The epidemic was brought under control.", "arabic_translation": "تم السيطرة على الوباء.", "level": "B2", "difficulty_score": 7, "category": "Medicine"},
{"german_text": "Die Antibiotika-Resistenz ist ein wachsendes Problem.", "english_translation": "Antibiotic resistance is a growing problem.", "arabic_translation": "مقاومة المضادات الحيوية مشكلة متنامية.", "level": "B2", "difficulty_score": 8, "category": "Medicine"},
{"german_text": "Die chirurgische Intervention war notwendig.", "english_translation": "The surgical intervention was necessary.", "arabic_translation": "كان التدخل الجراحي ضروريًا.", "level": "B2", "difficulty_score": 7, "category": "Medicine"},
